 untuk detik-detik yang layak dikenang melangkaui gambar."},"sections":[{"key":"intro","type":"page_intro","visible":true,"layout":"side","eyebrow":"About","headline":"Behind every memoir,\n*a thousand little feelings.*","body":"Ever After Memoir was created for the moments that deserve to be remembered beyond the photographs — the laughter, the happy tears, the quiet glances, and all the beautiful in-between.","media":{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016","url":"/brand/bride-window.jpg","type":"image","alt":"Bride in a beaded veil holding orchids, standing by the window light","width":1600,"height":2133,"poster":null,"isSample":false},"ms":{"eyebrow":"Tentang kami","headline":"Di sebalik setiap memoir,\n*seribu rasa kecil.*","body":"Ever After Memoir lahir untuk detik-detik yang layak dikenang melangkaui gambar — gelak tawa, air mata gembira, pandangan yang senyap, dan segala yang indah di antaranya."}},{"key":"team","type":"team","visible":true,"eyebrow":"The team","headline":"Two creators,\n*one way of seeing.*","body":"We are a team of two — wedding content creators first, photographers too. One of us is usually where the laughter is; the other is watching for the moment just after it.","members":[{"name":"","role":"Wedding content creator","bio":"","photo":null},{"name":"","role":"Wedding content creator & photographer","bio":"","photo":null}],"ms":{"eyebrow":"Pasukan kami","headline":"Dua pencipta,\n*satu cara melihat.*","body":"Kami pasukan dua orang — wedding content creator, dan juga jurugambar. Seorang biasanya berada di tempat gelak tawa; seorang lagi menanti detik sejurus selepasnya.","members.0.role":"Wedding content creator","members.1.role":"Wedding content creator & jurugambar"}},{"key":"approach","type":"text_image","visible":true,"eyebrow":"How we work","headline":"Close enough to feel it.\n*Quiet enough to miss nothing.*","body":"We stay near the moments that matter and out of the way of the ones that should simply happen.\n\nThe result is content that feels like being there again — the getting ready, the vows, the people you love, and everything in between.","media":{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000061","url":"/brand/getting-ready-poster.jpg","type":"image","alt":"Groom adjusting his songkok","width":720,"height":1280,"poster":null,"isSample":false},"imageSide":"right","ms":{"eyebrow":"Cara kami bekerja","headline":"Cukup dekat untuk merasainya.\n*Cukup senyap untuk tidak terlepas apa-apa.*","body":"Kami kekal dekat dengan detik yang penting, dan menjauh daripada detik yang sepatutnya berlaku dengan sendiri.\n\nHasilnya ialah kandungan yang terasa seperti berada di sana semula — saat bersiap, lafaz akad, orang yang anda sayang, dan segalanya di antaranya."}},{"key":"collage","type":"collage","visible":true,"eyebrow":"In between","headline":"The moments\n*no one planned.*","body":"A kiss on the hand. A laugh on the pelamin. The rings, finally where they belong.","items":[{"media":{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007","url":"/brand/salam-closeup.jpg","type":"image","alt":"Bride kissing the groom’s hand, eyes closed","width":424,"height":532,"poster":null,"isSample":false},"caption":"Salam"},{"media":{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009","url":"/brand/pelamin-laugh.jpg","type":"image","alt":"Groom and bride sharing a laugh on the pelamin","width":424,"height":533,"poster":null,"isSample":false},"caption":""},{"media":{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005","url":"/brand/bride-smile.jpg","type":"image","alt":"Bride in a tiara and veil smiling","width":462,"height":1089,"poster":null,"isSample":false},"caption":""},{"media":{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010","url":"/brand/rings-detail.jpg","type":"image","alt":"Close-up of the rings and henna","width":423,"height":533,"poster":null,"isSample":false},"caption":"Forever, on one finger"},{"media":{"id":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008","url":"/brand/pelamin-wide.jpg","type":"image","alt":"Couple seated on the pelamin surrounded by white flowers","width":423,"height":532,"poster":null,"isSample":false},"caption":""}],"link":{"label":"See the stories","href":"/stories"},"ms":{"eyebrow":"Di antaranya","headline":"Detik yang\n*tidak dirancang.*","body":"Kucupan di tangan. Tawa di pelamin. Cincin, akhirnya di tempatnya.","items.0.caption":"Salam","items.3.caption":"Selamanya, di satu jari","link.label":"Lihat kisah"}},{"key":"founder","type":"founder","visible":false,"eyebrow":"The person behind the camera","headline":"Hello, *I am…*","name":"","role":"","body":"","media":null},{"key":"quote","type":"quote","visible":true,"text":"Your day, as it felt — not just as it looked.","ms":{"text":"Hari anda, seperti yang dirasa — bukan sekadar rupanya."}},{"key":"cta","type":"cta","visible":true,"headline":"Let''s keep your\n*memories close.*","body":"We would love to hear about your day.","link":{"label":"Check your date","href":"/contact#book"},"ms":{"headline":"Mari simpan kenangan\n*anda dekat di hati.*","body":"Kami teruja untuk mendengar tentang hari anda.","link.label":"Semak tarikh anda"}}]}'::jsonb, now(), 3) on conflict (slug) do nothing;
insert into public.pages (id, slug, status, draft, published, published_at, sort_order) values ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000405', 'contact', 'published', '{"title":"Contact","seoTitle":"Book your date — Ever After Memoir","seoDescription":"Check which wedding dates are still available with Ever After Memoir, then book on WhatsApp.","ms":{"title":"Hubungi","seoTitle":"Tempah tarikh anda — Ever After Memoir","seoDescription":"Semak tarikh perkahwinan yang masih kosong dengan Ever After Memoir, kemudian tempah melalui WhatsApp."},"sections":[{"key":"book","type":"booking","visible":true,"eyebrow":"Book your date","headline":"Is your date\n*still free?*","body":"Pick your wedding date, tell us a little about your day, and we’ll continue on WhatsApp.","note":"Dates marked “Few slots left” already have another booking. Your date is confirmed once we reply.","ms":{"eyebrow":"Tempah tarikh anda","headline":"Tarikh anda\n*masih kosong?*","body":"Pilih tarikh majlis, ceritakan sedikit tentang hari anda, dan kita sambung di WhatsApp.","note":"Tarikh bertanda “Slot terhad” sudah ada tempahan lain. Tarikh anda disahkan selepas kami membalas."}},{"key":"inquiry","type":"inquiry","visible":true,"headline":"Prefer email?\n*Send a detailed inquiry.*","body":"Tell us a little about your day, your plans, and the moments you want to remember most.","successHeadline":"Thank you — *we have your message.*","successBody":"We read every inquiry personally and will reply to the email you gave us.","privacyNote":"We only use these details to reply to your inquiry and plan your coverage. We never sell or share them.","ms":{"headline":"Lebih suka emel?\n*Hantar pertanyaan terperinci.*","body":"Ceritakan sedikit tentang hari anda, rancangan anda, dan detik yang paling ingin anda kenang.","successHeadline":"Terima kasih — *mesej anda sudah kami terima.*","successBody":"Kami membaca setiap pertanyaan sendiri dan akan membalas ke emel yang anda berikan.","privacyNote":"Kami hanya menggunakan maklumat ini untuk membalas pertanyaan dan merancang liputan anda. Kami tidak pernah menjual atau berkongsi maklumat anda."}}]}'::jsonb, '{"title":"Contact","seoTitle":"Book your date — Ever After Memoir","seoDescription":"Check which wedding dates are still available with Ever After Memoir, then book on WhatsApp.","ms":{"title":"Hubungi","seoTitle":"Tempah tarikh anda — Ever After Memoir","seoDescription":"Semak tarikh perkahwinan yang masih kosong dengan Ever After Memoir, kemudian tempah melalui WhatsApp."},"sections":[{"key":"book","type":"booking","visible":true,"eyebrow":"Book your date","headline":"Is your date\n*still free?*","body":"Pick your wedding date, tell us a little about your day, and we’ll continue on WhatsApp.","note":"Dates marked “Few slots left” already have another booking. Your date is confirmed once we reply.","ms":{"eyebrow":"Tempah tarikh anda","headline":"Tarikh anda\n*masih kosong?*","body":"Pilih tarikh majlis, ceritakan sedikit tentang hari anda, dan kita sambung di WhatsApp.","note":"Tarikh bertanda “Slot terhad” sudah ada tempahan lain. Tarikh anda disahkan selepas kami membalas."}},{"key":"inquiry","type":"inquiry","visible":true,"headline":"Prefer email?\n*Send a detailed inquiry.*","body":"Tell us a little about your day, your plans, and the moments you want to remember most.","successHeadline":"Thank you — *we have your message.*","successBody":"We read every inquiry personally and will reply to the email you gave us.","privacyNote":"We only use these details to reply to your inquiry and plan your coverage. We never sell or share them.","ms":{"headline":"Lebih suka emel?\n*Hantar pertanyaan terperinci.*","body":"Ceritakan sedikit tentang hari anda, rancangan anda, dan detik yang paling ingin anda kenang.","successHeadline":"Terima kasih — *mesej anda sudah kami terima.*","successBody":"Kami membaca setiap pertanyaan sendiri dan akan membalas ke emel yang anda berikan.","privacyNote":"Kami hanya menggunakan maklumat ini untuk membalas pertanyaan dan merancang liputan anda. Kami tidak pernah menjual atau berkongsi maklumat anda."}}]}'::jsonb, now(), 4) on conflict (slug) do nothing;
insert into public.pages (id, slug, status, draft, published, published_at, sort_order) values ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000406', 'privacy', 'published', '{"title":"Privacy","seoTitle":"Privacy policy — Ever After Memoir","seoDescription":"How Ever After Memoir handles the personal details you share with us.","ms":{"title":"Privasi","seoTitle":"Dasar privasi — Ever After Memoir","seoDescription":"Cara Ever After Memoir mengendalikan maklumat peribadi yang anda kongsi dengan kami."},"sections":[{"key":"policy","type":"rich_text","visible":true,"headline":"Privacy policy","body":"## What we collect\n\nWhen you book a date or send an inquiry, we receive the details you type in: your name, your partner’s name, email, WhatsApp number, wedding date, location, the type of celebration, the service you are interested in, an optional budget and any notes.\n\n## Why we collect it\n\nWe use these details only to reply to you, prepare a quote and plan coverage for your wedding. When you book through WhatsApp, the conversation continues in WhatsApp under its own privacy terms.\n\n## Who can see it\n\nYour inquiry is stored securely and is only visible to the Ever After Memoir team. We do not sell, rent or share your details with anyone for marketing.\n\n## How long we keep it\n\nWe keep inquiries for as long as we need them to work with you, and delete closed inquiries we no longer need.\n\n## Your choices\n\nYou can ask us at any time to see, correct or delete the details you sent. Reply to any message from us or send a new inquiry with your request.\n\n## Cookies\n\nThis website does not use advertising or tracking cookies.","ms":{"headline":"Dasar privasi","body":"## Apa yang kami kumpul\n\nApabila anda menempah tarikh atau menghantar pertanyaan, kami menerima maklumat yang anda isi: nama anda, nama pasangan, emel, nombor WhatsApp, tarikh majlis, lokasi, jenis majlis, servis yang diminati, bajet (pilihan) dan sebarang nota.\n\n## Mengapa kami mengumpulnya\n\nKami menggunakan maklumat ini hanya untuk membalas anda, menyediakan sebut harga dan merancang liputan majlis anda. Apabila anda menempah melalui WhatsApp, perbualan diteruskan di WhatsApp di bawah terma privasinya sendiri.\n\n## Siapa yang boleh melihatnya\n\nPertanyaan anda disimpan dengan selamat dan hanya boleh dilihat oleh pasukan Ever After Memoir. Kami tidak menjual, menyewa atau berkongsi maklumat anda dengan sesiapa untuk tujuan pemasaran.\n\n## Berapa lama kami menyimpannya\n\nKami menyimpan pertanyaan selama yang diperlukan untuk bekerja dengan anda, dan memadam pertanyaan yang telah selesai apabila tidak diperlukan lagi.\n\n## Pilihan anda\n\nAnda boleh meminta pada bila-bila masa untuk melihat, membetulkan atau memadam maklumat yang anda hantar. Balas mana-mana mesej daripada kami atau hantar pertanyaan baharu dengan permintaan anda.\n\n## Kuki\n\nWebsite ini tidak menggunakan kuki pengiklanan atau penjejakan."}}]}'::jsonb, '{"title":"Privacy","seoTitle":"Privacy policy — Ever After Memoir","seoDescription":"How Ever After Memoir handles the personal details you share with us.","ms":{"title":"Privasi","seoTitle":"Dasar privasi — Ever After Memoir","seoDescription":"Cara Ever After Memoir mengendalikan maklumat peribadi yang anda kongsi dengan kami."},"sections":[{"key":"policy","type":"rich_text","visible":true,"headline":"Privacy policy","body":"## What we collect\n\nWhen you book a date or send an inquiry, we receive the details you type in: your name, your partner’s name, email, WhatsApp number, wedding date, location, the type of celebration, the service you are interested in, an optional budget and any notes.\n\n## Why we collect it\n\nWe use these details only to reply to you, prepare a quote and plan coverage for your wedding. When you book through WhatsApp, the conversation continues in WhatsApp under its own privacy terms.\n\n## Who can see it\n\nYour inquiry is stored securely and is only visible to the Ever After Memoir team. We do not sell, rent or share your details with anyone for marketing.\n\n## How long we keep it\n\nWe keep inquiries for as long as we need them to work with you, and delete closed inquiries we no longer need.\n\n## Your choices\n\nYou can ask us at any time to see, correct or delete the details you sent. Reply to any message from us or send a new inquiry with your request.\n\n## Cookies\n\nThis website does not use advertising or tracking cookies.","ms":{"headline":"Dasar privasi","body":"## Apa yang kami kumpul\n\nApabila anda menempah tarikh atau menghantar pertanyaan, kami menerima maklumat yang anda isi: nama anda, nama pasangan, emel, nombor WhatsApp, tarikh majlis, lokasi, jenis majlis, servis yang diminati, bajet (pilihan) dan sebarang nota.\n\n## Mengapa kami mengumpulnya\n\nKami menggunakan maklumat ini hanya untuk membalas anda, menyediakan sebut harga dan merancang liputan majlis anda. Apabila anda menempah melalui WhatsApp, perbualan diteruskan di WhatsApp di bawah terma privasinya sendiri.\n\n## Siapa yang boleh melihatnya\n\nPertanyaan anda disimpan dengan selamat dan hanya boleh dilihat oleh pasukan Ever After Memoir. Kami tidak menjual, menyewa atau berkongsi maklumat anda dengan sesiapa untuk tujuan pemasaran.\n\n## Berapa lama kami menyimpannya\n\nKami menyimpan pertanyaan selama yang diperlukan untuk bekerja dengan anda, dan memadam pertanyaan yang telah selesai apabila tidak diperlukan lagi.\n\n## Pilihan anda\n\nAnda boleh meminta pada bila-bila masa untuk melihat, membetulkan atau memadam maklumat yang anda hantar. Balas mana-mana mesej daripada kami atau hantar pertanyaan baharu dengan permintaan anda.\n\n## Kuki\n\nWebsite ini tidak menggunakan kuki pengiklanan atau penjejakan."}}]}'::jsonb, now(), 5) on conflict (slug) do nothing;
